      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "1. Describe a time when you championed an idea that was initially met with resistance; how did you drive that concept toward successful implementation, demonstrating an innovative approach?\n2. Tell me about a complex project where achieving true synergy required integrating diverse viewpoints; what specific actions did you take to foster that teamwork?\n3. Give an example of a significant professional setback where your growth-mindset allowed you to pivot and learn, ultimately leading to a more innovative solution.\n4. Walk me through a situation where cross-functional collaboration was critical to success; how did you ensure all team members felt their input contributed to the overall synergy?\n5. When faced with an ambiguous problem, how do you approach it to foster innovation while ensuring strong collaboration across different departments?",
